t right & facing left\nW2[0:7, 7] = -16\nW2[24, 7] = 16\nb2[7] = -119.92\n# 8,9: target left / right in my row -> stay and fire\nW2[0:7, 8] = 16\nb2[8] = 88\nW2[0:7, 9] = -16\nb2[9] = -104\n# 10: nav down = D & not Surf\nW2[22, 10] = 8\nW2[25, 10] = -8\nb2[10] = -8\n# 11: nav up = U & not D & not Surf\nW2[23, 11] = 8\nW2[22, 11] = -8\nW2[25, 11] = -8\nb2[11] = -16\n# 12: drift down (above mid, not Surf); 13: drift up\nW2[30, 12] = 16\nW2[25, 12] = -8\nb2[12] = -16\nW2[30, 13] = -16\nb2[13] = -8\n# 14: veto up (above blocked); 15: veto down (below blocked); 16: veto down (wait at surface)\nW2[14:22, 14] = -16\nb2[14] = -120\nW2[14:22, 15] = 16\nb2[15] = 104\nW2[27, 16] = 8\n# 17: dodge up at row 8\nW2[7:14, 17] = 8\nW2[31, 17] = 8\nb2[17] = 40\n\n# ================= output =================\nW3[0, 4] = 1280\nW3[1, 2] = 1280\nW3[17, 2] = 1280\nW3[2, 3] = 640\nW3[3, 1] = 640\nW3[4, 2] = 320\nW3[5, 4] = 160\nW3[6, 1] = 80\nW3[7, 3] = 80\nW3[8, 5] = 40\nW3[9, 5] = 40\nW3[10, 4] = 20\nW3[11, 2] = 20\nW3[12, 4] = 10\nW3[13, 2] = 10\nW3[14, 2] = -2500\nW3[15, 4] = -2500\nW3[16, 4] = -2500\nb3[0:6] = [0, 720, 410, 720, -3530, 90]\n```"
